# The build-context prune (master plan Phase 8): Dockerfile's build stage
# does COPY . . — without this file the whole working tree (local DBs,
# backups, screenshots, gitignored validation evidence, node_modules,
# build output) ships into the context. The context carries the SOURCE;
# everything else stays on the host.
.git
.gitignore
node_modules
npm-debug.log*
.next
next-daemon.log
worker-daemon.log
dev.log
db
backups
uploads
validation
docs/baselines/*.png
docs/baselines/*.mp4
scratch
test-results
playwright-report
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal
*.sqlite-wal
*.sqlite-shm
